Read the problem. Ask these questions in order:

Does it ask for the k largest / k smallest / k-th element?
→ YES → Type 1 (Top K — heap of size k)

Does it involve merging multiple sorted sequences?
→ YES → Type 2 (Merge K Sorted — min-heap across sources)

Does it ask for a median or require tracking both halves?
→ YES → Type 3 (Two Heaps)

Does it involve scheduling, task assignment, "minimum time"?
→ YES → Type 4 (Scheduling + Greedy)

Does it involve a sliding window or removing specific elements?
→ YES → Type 5 (Lazy Deletion)

