THE HEAP CHEAT SHEET — ONE LINE EACH
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

k largest elements → min-heap of size k
k smallest elements → max-heap of size k
k-th largest → min-heap of size k, return top()
Merge k sorted sequences → min-heap seeded with first element of each
Median of a stream → max-heap (left) + min-heap (right), balanced
"Always pick most urgent" → max-heap on priority
Remove arbitrary element → lazy deletion with a hashmap
